The data in resources/quran-uthmani.json was mechanically converted from
Tanzil's official Uthmani XML export (same Version 1.1 text, same
copyright block reproduced above) into a flat JSON array of
{ surahNumber, surahName, ayahNumber, text } objects. The Arabic text and
surah names were not altered, normalised, or "cleaned" in any way; only
the container format was changed from XML to JSON.

No translation of the Quran is bundled with this application.

resources/fonts/AmiriQuran.ttf
-------------------------------
Source: Amiri Quran, from the Amiri type project
        https://github.com/aliftype/amiri/releases/download/1.003/Amiri-1.003.zip
        (release 1.003, file AmiriQuran.ttf from the release archive)
Copyright 2010-2022 The Amiri Project Authors (https://github.com/aliftype/amiri)
License: SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1)
         https://openfontlicense.org/

The font's own embedded metadata (its TrueType `name` table) identifies it as
Family "Amiri Quran", Full name "Amiri Quran Regular", Manufacturer
"Alif Type", and carries the OFL 1.1 license string directly in its
nameID 13 record — this was verified programmatically before bundling by
reading the font's binary name table, not by trusting the filename.

The full OFL 1.1 license text (as shipped in the upstream release archive's
OFL.txt) applies to this font. It permits bundling, embedding, and
redistribution with this application; the font itself may not be sold on
its own and its Reserved Font Name ("Amiri Quran") may not be used to
label a modified version.

OFL 1.1 condition 2 requires that the license text be included with, not
merely linked from, each copy — so the full text is bundled verbatim at
resources/fonts/OFL.txt (copied unmodified from the same release archive,
Amiri-1.003.zip, file OFL.txt).

