self-generated, it carries no third-party licensing terms; it is original
work created for and owned by this project.

resources/cities.json
-----------------------------
Source: GeoNames geographical database, cities15000 export
        https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/cities15000.zip
        Country names from
        https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/countryInfo.txt
Copyright (C) GeoNames
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC-BY 4.0)
         https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Used to let the user choose their location offline, so prayer times can be
calculated on the user's own machine without contacting a geocoding
service. The application makes no network request to GeoNames at runtime.

Changes made (as CC-BY 4.0 requires be indicated): the export was reduced
to the fields this application uses — name, ASCII name, country code,
first-level administrative code, latitude, longitude, timezone and
population — coordinates were rounded to four decimal places, entries
lacking a timezone were dropped, and the rows were sorted by descending
population and re-serialised from tab-separated text into JSON. No name,
coordinate or timezone value was otherwise altered. The conversion is
reproducible with tools/make-cities.mjs.

